en Yogurt"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"3MIvd8aVC5N13sY8mq8wtg","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":713,"mm_rank":557,"target_category_support_fraction":0.5,"selected_image_count":5,"label_diversity":3,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Ice Cream & Frozen Yogurt","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3MIvd8aVC5N13sY8mq8wtg","review_id":"DeBPtwo848UKvocntMhObw","date":"2020-09-26T15:44:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9399644732475281,"text_excerpt":"Parish Parlor is a cute new ice cream shop on Magazine! There is outdoor patio seating in the back, and a few tables out front. Staff is super welcoming and friendly, offering as many samples as you need to make your choice. I had the Lavendar Fog and Mint Chocolate -- they let you split the flavors for single scoop! The flavors were strong, which I loved, and the ice cream felt very light, though was a little on the icy side -- that's probably because of the nature of the flavors I picked though. Their Mint Chocolate is probably one of my favorites because the mint flavor tastes fresh, not artificial. The Lavendar Fog had a potent earl grey flavor, and is vegan with a coconut milk base. ..."},{"business_id":"3MIvd8aVC5N13sY8mq8wtg","review_id":"Kue5pFLIG_bmau-uGPixHg","date":"2020-10-01T00:02:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9340429306030273,"text_excerpt":"I saw a post about the newest ice cream place in New Orleans on Instagram and because they are one of the few places in the city that is one on Mondays and stays open late (9PM) I took my friends for an afternoon sweet treat! I'm so glad I did! This place on the end of Magazine Street as you get close to the French Quarter was so cute and quaint. I loved the style and what was more the flavors they offer like lemon ricotta honey, cinnamon roll, and salted caramel to name a few. What's more is right now they have seasonal pumpkin spice waffle cones that you absolutely have to try! The staff was so nice and they have both magazine street outdoor seating and a few chairs in a courtyard in th..."},{"business_id":"3MIvd8aVC5N13sY8mq8wtg","review_id":"InMDcRSgVmqfDIn9Jr935g","date":"2020-11-24T03:41:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9309121370315552,"text_excerpt":"I'm happy a new ice cream place has popped up in this area. This location is near many other restaurants so it will be good to swing by after dinner or lunch. They have a good selection of unique and expected ice cream flavors. The service was great and let you sample flavors as well. Currently there is no indoor seating, but there was a table and chairs outside to enjoy the ice cream plus there is a little green space across the street where you can sit as well. Although I liked my ice cream, I did think $4 was pricey for a single scoop for the size it was. That being said, I will still probably come by when I get that ice cream itch."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3MIvd8aVC5N13sY8mq8wtg","photo_id":"PQxHjgh5ad6H3FSANECDpQ","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/PQxHjgh5ad6H3FSANECDpQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9617511034011841},{"business_id":"3MIvd8aVC5N13sY8mq8wtg","photo_id":"3VxqYMxQ23tyyF_4KeKBqg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/3VxqYMxQ23tyyF_4KeKBqg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9276448488235474},{"business_id":"3MIvd8aVC5N13sY8mq8wtg","photo_id":"YQmns9pwYqGrxDuqFPzL9Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/YQmns9pwYqGrxDuqFPzL9Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8667421340942383},{"business_id":"3MIvd8aVC5N13sY8mq8wtg","photo_id":"-5ekv9Nm1lvmdjIiuR8emQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-5ekv9Nm1lvmdjIiuR8emQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8528398275375366},{"business_id":"3MIvd8aVC5N13sY8mq8wtg","photo_id":"ENZig90v5ywMrZ3-nOhTNw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ENZig90v5ywMrZ3-nOhTNw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.850798487663269}]},"notebook_case":null}
